      <title>Claude 被封号后我找到了新的办公搭子</title>
      <link>https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwNzc2NTk0NQ==&amp;mid=2247623408&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=bf12230c1cb55313544ac10f53314d8f</link>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>原创 <span>夕小瑶编辑部</span> <span>2026-11-13 20:05</span> <span style="display: inline-block;">山东</span></p>






  
  <p><img src="https://wechat2rss.xlab.app/img-proxy/?k=784fd141&amp;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2F0hd8MxUumHNSjh15oXF4u3plocOn9DA7cWjumr8AdUpAwo9sibrrokO9CaKVdJeZ8sH1kgt54fFY6dXkvJrpg7nGGgbhEQDZI3gRC43xE03s%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg"/></p>
  
  <p style="color:#505050;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.2px;line-height:2;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 12px;font-weight:400;" data-tool="mdnice编辑器" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf="">前天，我的Claude 账号被封了。</span></p><p style="color:#505050;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.2px;line-height:2;margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 12px;font-weight:400;" data-tool="mdnice编辑器"><span leaf="">事情发生得很突然。当时我在处理一个财务任务，大概有几十张发票，外加几份 Excel 报表，活儿已经干了一半了，突然让我做认证，然后账号就没了。。</span></p><p style="color:#505050;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:0.2px;line-height:2;margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:8px 10px 8px 12px;font-weight:400;" data-tool="mdnice编辑器" nodeleaf="">]]></content:encoded>
